-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-lg">Noise phobia logging</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Storm and firework responses captured with intensity scoring.</p></div></li><li><div class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-7 shadow-soft transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lift h-full"><h3 class="text-lg">Severity index</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">A single comparable number so you can prove a programme is working.</p></div></li></ul></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24 bg-primary text-primary-foreground"><div class="container-page"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center"><div><p class="mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">Outcomes</p><h2 class="text-3xl leading-tight sm:text-4xl">What owners typically see</h2><ul class="mt-8 space-y-4"><li class="flex gap-3 text-lg leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/85"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Separation anxiety severity graded rather than guessed.</li><li class="flex gap-3 text-lg leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/85"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Evidence for whether medication or supplements are having an effect.</li><li class="flex gap-3 text-lg leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/85"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-3 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Clear thresholds for when to escalate to a veterinary behaviourist.</li></ul></div><img alt="PawlogicTech hardware used for anxiety detection" class="w-full rounded-3xl object-cover shadow-lift" decoding="async" height="900" loading="lazy" src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() ); ?>/assets/images/tech-sensor.webp" width="1200"/></div></div></section><section class="py-20 sm:py-24"><div class="containe